ntication:** Run `gemini` and follow the prompts to log in with your Google account or provide an API key.\n3.  **Usage:** Simply type your request in natural language (e.g., \"Fix the bug in auth.ts\" or \"Explain how the routing works\").\n\n### **Key Commands**\n*   `/help`: Displays a guide to available commands and features.\n*   `/model`: Switches between different Gemini models (e.g., Gemini 2.0 Pro, Flash).\n*   `/tools`: Lists the tools currently available to the agent.\n*   `/memory`: Manages persistent information the agent should remember across sessions.[9]\n*   `/mcp`: Manages Model Context Protocol server connections.[2][7]\n\n### **Documentation Resources**\n*   **Official Docs:** [Gemini CLI Documentation](https://google-gemini.github.io/gemini-cli/)\n*   **GitHub Repository:** [google-gemini/gemini-cli](https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli)[1]\n*   **Learning Path:** [DeepLearning.AI Gemini CLI Course](https://www.deeplearning.ai/short-courses/google-gemini-cli/)\n\nFor specific questions about how to use me (this instance of Gemini CLI), you can also ask me directly or use the `/help` command.\n\nSources:\n[1] github.com (https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGAjEw7a2x2bLRIuepud8c8ei5Go8yQK9HOcYiGY3rhemusnh4gqUv9sEq4-PrIgZGZJ6V0lB98zip-hLq2PmqQW-XOvHynRfr1dn1sgPqbBuVQvSOfDXWwBRSiIP1GGSCkuIFgNg==)\n[2] google.com (https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHMS5ouUZAYrAvXc0XhoyLqpOIVzN4HoZU7RwrFoxw_MXjr7ORzpV0PUhteQukCbkf3g3cxYnOzpiqSvA_LwcYWm5nj32hxCPXNkyL1iijWe1BgvJeRdS3pN4SewiEE_lLLtCMekGutoQzC3Ryjs_krVYOkb-xgil19)\n[3] datacamp.com (https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHU2d-2dyfbdcrLhIzGtFpXKrcdW_et8nW_1aJwWsbeOTEozNpvHGkYxkIu6iZtP1dZZcxE-UYBrPd2A6X1wGymr2GUTgpbRnpG3uOxjBlPsHisUXitzLlmS-Ok02ZSNzVkeSjpnFQ=)\n[4] blog.google (https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHwzCmgb4S2xUqmN5uN7X0w-fn9he3X1qChWPo1f_aTfNq0X-n5KLu5jFXG7v